<h1>3. Technology Stack</h1>

<table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Technology</th><th>Version</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
  <tr><td><b>Language</b></td><td>TypeScript</td><td>5.7+</td><td>End-to-end type safety across frontend, backend, and shared code</td></tr>
  <tr><td><b>Backend Framework</b></td><td>Express.js</td><td>4.21</td><td>REST API server with middleware pipeline</td></tr>
