<!-- ═══════════════════ CHAPTER 13 ═══════════════════ -->
<h1>13. Setup &amp; Deployment Guide</h1>

<h2>13.1 Prerequisites</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Node.js ≥ 20.0.0</li>
  <li>npm (bundled with Node.js)</li>
  <li>Git (for cloning)</li>
</ul>

<h2>13.2 Environment Configuration</h2>
<p>Create a <code>.env</code> file in the <code>fwms/</code> root directory:</p>
<div class="code-block"># ───── Database ─────
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# ───── JWT ─────
JWT_ACCESS_SECRET="dev-access-secret-change-in-production-32chars"
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET="dev-refresh-secret-change-in-production-32chars"
JWT_ACCESS_EXPIRY="15m"
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRY="7d"

# ───── Server ─────
API_PORT=4000
API_URL="http://localhost:4000"
FRONTEND_URL="http://localhost:3000"
NODE_ENV="development"

# ───── Rate Limiting ─────
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_MAX=10
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_GENERAL_MAX=100
RATE_LIMIT_GENERAL_WINDOW_MS=60000

# ───── Logging ─────
LOG_LEVEL="debug"</div>

<h2>13.3 Installation &amp; Launch</h2>
<div class="code-block"># 1. Install all dependencies across workspaces
npm install

# 2. Apply database schema and create dev.db
npm run db:migrate

# 3. Seed initial data (admin users, norms, departments)
npm run db:seed

# 4. Start both API (port 4000) and Web (port 3000) simultaneously
npm run dev</div>

<h2>13.4 Additional Scripts</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Command</th><th>Description</th></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run dev:api</code></td><td>Run only the backend API server</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run dev:web</code></td><td>Run only the frontend web server</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run build</code></td><td>Build shared → API → Web for production</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run typecheck</code></td><td>Run TypeScript type checking across all packages</td></tr>
  <tr><td><code>npm run db:studio</code></td><td>Open Prisma Studio (visual database browser)</td></tr>
</table>

