<h1>14. Future Scope</h1>
<ol>
  <li><b>Email Notifications:</b> SMTP integration for approval notifications, SLA escalation alerts, and password reset flows</li>
  <li><b>PDF Export:</b> Server-side PDF generation of workload reports using Puppeteer or jsPDF</li>
  <li><b>Timetable Integration:</b> Cross-reference allocations with class timetables to detect time-slot conflicts</li>
  <li><b>Analytics History:</b> Term-over-term comparison charts showing workload trends per department</li>
  <li><b>PostgreSQL Migration:</b> Upgrade from SQLite to PostgreSQL for production deployment with connection pooling</li>
  <li><b>Real-time Updates:</b> WebSocket or Server-Sent Events for live dashboard updates and notification delivery</li>
  <li><b>Mobile App:</b> React Native companion app for faculty to view their allocations and approval statuses</li>
  <li><b>Bulk Import:</b> CSV/Excel upload for batch creation of faculty, subjects, and class divisions</li>
  <li><b>Advanced AI Features:</b> Extend Gemini integration to suggest optimal faculty-subject assignments based on historical data and workload balance</li>
</ol>

